<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 8.3 percent in the week ended February 7, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 12.1 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 6.9 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 12.1 percent to 379.2 from 338.4 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 0.7 percent to 177.8 in the latest survey from 176.6 in the previous week.  </p>
